l很麻煩，所以用非監督式"],"execution_count":221,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"R8ilQcQBSymd"},"source":["## 1.Naive Bayes Classifier(單純貝氏分類器NBC)"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"bmtgBJUb3l_7","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1622288873102,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":390,"user":{"displayName":"北科大-張嘉芸","photoUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GhcM20C68MTH2x-G3yrqTq1HFjNhhYDEa_xSvay=s64","userId":"11213870514507527976"}}},"source":["#What:基於貝葉斯定理，特徵之間條件獨立假設的分類方法P(x1|y)=P(x1|y,x2,x3...xn)\n","#How:樸素貝葉斯分類器(Naive Bayes Classifier,或 NBC)發源於古典數學理論，有著堅實的數學基礎，以及穩定的分類效率。理論上，NBC模型與其他分類方法相比具有最小的誤差率。但是實際上並非總是如此，這是因為NBC模型假設屬性之間相互獨立，這個假設在實際應用中往往是不成立的，這給NBC模型的正確分類帶來了一定影響。\n","#https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/naive_bayes.html"],"execution_count":222,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"BQQph4nQo41E","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1622288873102,"user_tz":-480,"elapsed":11,"user":{"displayName":"北科大-張嘉芸","photoUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GhcM20C68MTH2x-G3yrqTq1HFjNhhYDEa_xSvay=s64","userId":"11213870514507527976"}},"outputId":"35a1fa8e-0e62-4fb0-82a7-ab66d44c391d"},"source":["#例子1\n","from sklearn import tree\n","from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n","from sklearn import datasets\n","from sklearn.metrics import accuracy_score\n","from sklearn.naive_bayes import GaussianNB\n","\n","iris = datasets.load_iris()  #load進iris的資料庫\n","\n","features = iris.feature_names\n","X = iris.data  \n","y = iris.target\n","\n","X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(X, y, test_size=0.3, random_state=42)  #shuffle\n","gnb = GaussianNB()\n","y_result = gnb.fit(X_train, y_train).predict(X_test)\n","\n","accuracy_score(y_test, y_result)\n","print(\"Number of mislabeled points out of a total %d points : %d\"% (X_test.shape[0],(y_test != y_result).sum()))"],"execution_count":223,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","text":["Number of mis